            </note>
            <note corresp="#d112-f2" n="12" xml:id="d112-f2-content">
                <p>For the report on the informal Council meeting under reference, see telegram
                    1143, Delsec 1379, April 1, from Moscow, <ref
                        target="#pg303">p. 303</ref>.</p>
            </note>
